{"actionability": 4, "autonomy": 4, "blind_sha256": "604f7ef428507431432550d993d7aec337cd666d7f9cf33eb31197b13649a0f6", "blocker": false, "concision": 4, "correctness": 5, "criteria": [true, true, true], "evaluation_id": "product-business-prd-scenario-r2-sol-judge", "judge": "product-business-prd-scenario-r2-sol-judge", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "judged_at": "2026-08-31T07:51:10.983711Z", "label": "A", "notes": "明确拒绝将客户旅程、流程活动和能力混为同一语义，并分别给出价值阶段、业务运行活动/交接和稳定能力。用表格及显式多对多原则关联三者；还按体验优化与能力投资区分最小视图组合。主要不足是原材料未提供时只能给模板，且流程图较概括。", "pair_id": "product-business-architecture-should-separate-value-and-process:3", "safety": 5}
